"JguWG"><span lang="fr"><span class="yCeTE">Nous avons adoré la nature éclectique et variée de ce couple évidemment très éduqué - même si ce n’est pas tout à notre goût, nous avons pu apprécier les efforts nécessaires pour amasser cette jolie collection. Et les affiches de voyage remontent à une période où les voyages étaient beaucoup moins faciles ni accessibles. Recommandé</span></span></span></div></div><div class="lszDU"><button class="UikNM _G B- _S _W u _T c G_ wSSLS xhwUe utTrc" type="button"><span class="biGQs _P ezezH">Plus</span><div class="CECjK _W PH"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20px" height="20px" class="d Vb UmNoP" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18.4 7.4 12 13.7 5.6 7.4 4.2 8.8l7.8 7.8 7.8-7.8z"></path></svg></div></button></div></div><div></div><div class="SzfHp _e f"><div class="BePvm"><button class="UikNM _G B- _S _W u _T c G_ wSSLS xhwUe" type="button" aria-label="Voir l&#x27;image complète"><span class="biGQs _P ezezH"><picture class="NhWcC _R o afQPz SyjMH qcDHf" style="width:100px;height:100px"><img srcSet="https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/2f/83/c5/e7/caption.jpg?w=100&amp;h=-1&amp;s=1 1x,https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/2f/83/c5/e7/caption.jpg?w=200&amp;h=200&amp;s=1 2x" src="https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/2f/83/c5/e7/caption.jpg?w=100&amp;h=-1&amp;s=1" width="100" height="134" alt="" loading="lazy"/></picture></span></button></div><div class="BePvm"><button class="UikNM _G B- _S _W u _T c G_ wSSLS xhwUe" type="button" aria-label="Voir l&#x27;image complète"><span class="biGQs _P ezezH"><picture class="NhWcC _R o afQPz SyjMH qcDHf" style="width:100px;height:100px"><img srcSet="https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/2f/83/c5/e8/caption.jpg?w=100&amp;h=-1&amp;s=1 1x,https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/2f/83/c5/e8/caption.jpg?w=200&amp;h=200&amp;s=1 2x" src="https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/2f/83/c5/e8/caption.jpg?w=